WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.028 --> 00:00:13.429
slid deeper inside the plant.

2
00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:16.910
"Ugh!" Roxy cried.

3
00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.972
"It's so hot and sticky in here!"

4
00:00:20.992 --> 00:00:22.212
Finally she stopped moving.

5
00:00:22.233 --> 00:00:25.334
"I must be in a pod now," Roxy said.

6
00:00:26.154 --> 00:00:27.755
She tried to move her arms and legs.

7
00:00:29.175 --> 00:00:30.076
But there was no room.

8
00:00:31.828 --> 00:00:33.849
"I better get out.

9
00:00:34.369 --> 00:00:38.171
I'm getting She let out a big yawn.

10
00:00:38.191 --> 00:00:43.673
"Sleepy." Roxy shook her head.

11
00:00:43.693 --> 00:00:46.014
"Don't fall asleep!"

12
00:00:46.814 --> 00:00:47.555
She told herself.

13
00:00:48.235 --> 00:00:50.096
She tried firing her eye laser beams.

14
00:00:50.836 --> 00:00:52.497
But there wasn't enough room in the pod.

15
00:00:52.517 --> 00:00:55.938
"Maybe my heat vision will work," Roxy thought.

16
00:00:58.259 --> 00:00:59.780
The heat vision didn't harm the plant.

17
00:01:00.684 --> 00:01:02.565
The inside of the pod only grew hotter.

18
00:01:03.546 --> 00:01:05.147
Roxy tried her freeze breath next.

19
00:01:07.068 --> 00:01:08.249
She heard a crackling sound.

20
00:01:09.090 --> 00:01:10.871
The inside of the pod became gray.

21
00:01:10.891 --> 00:01:13.173
"Yes!" Roxy cried.

22
00:01:13.193 --> 00:01:16.215
"My freeze breath is killing the plant!"

23
00:01:16.995 --> 00:01:19.097
She blew harder.

24
00:01:19.117 --> 00:01:20.538
The pod withered and died.

25
00:01:22.279 --> 00:01:23.860
Roxy punched a hole through the pod.

26
00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:25.321
"I'm free!"

27
00:01:26.021 --> 00:01:27.382
The plant had many other pods.

28
00:01:28.023 --> 00:01:29.424
Roxy saw the pods wiggling.

29
00:01:30.316 --> 00:01:31.076
People were in them.

30
00:01:31.956 --> 00:01:34.017
She blew her freeze breath all over the plant.

31
00:01:35.677 --> 00:01:37.438
Soon the giant plant fell over dead.

32
00:01:40.139 --> 00:01:41.359
People climbed out of the pods.

33
00:01:41.379 --> 00:01:45.020
"Thank you, Rocket Girl!"

34
00:01:45.440 --> 00:01:46.040
a man said.

35
00:01:46.060 --> 00:01:48.061
"No problem!"

36
00:01:48.361 --> 00:01:48.961
Roxy said.

37
00:01:49.781 --> 00:01:52.322
Then she saw Vic Nebula fly off in her spaceship.

38
00:01:53.122 --> 00:01:54.603
Vic was zooming toward a wormhole!

39
00:01:54.623 --> 00:01:58.824
"Vic is going to escape through that wormhole!"

40
00:01:59.044 --> 00:01:59.624
Roxy said.

41
00:02:00.388 --> 00:02:01.849
"I can't let her get away!"

42
00:02:02.569 --> 00:02:03.709
Roxy shot after the villain.

43
00:02:04.890 --> 00:02:05.830
Vines reached for her.

44
00:02:06.751 --> 00:02:08.031
Giant mouths snapped at her.

45
00:02:09.492 --> 00:02:12.133
Roxy zigzagged to avoid them.

46
00:02:13.674 --> 00:02:18.336
Whiz-hoo! Roxy's eye laser beams hit Vic's spaceship.

47
00:02:18.756 --> 00:02:20.677
Smoke poured from it.

48
00:02:20.697 --> 00:02:22.317
The spaceship crashed near the wormhole.

49
00:02:23.718 --> 00:02:26.239
Vic Nebula jumped out and ran toward the wormhole.

50
00:02:27.079 --> 00:02:28.680
She looked over her shoulder at Roxy.

51
00:02:29.280 --> 00:02:30.901
"Good-bye, Rocket Girl!

52
00:02:31.381 --> 00:02:34.563
I'm going back to—" A mouth snapped.

53
00:02:34.643 --> 00:02:37.325
Gulp! Roxy laughed.

54
00:02:38.545 --> 00:02:39.406
"That was easy!"

55
00:02:40.166 --> 00:02:41.147
Then she looked around.

56
00:02:41.167 --> 00:02:45.929
"Now I just need to destroy all the other plants and free everyone."

57
00:02:48.771 --> 00:02:50.772
A little later Roxy freed Detective Smith.

58
00:02:50.792 --> 00:02:54.374
"Thanks, Rocket Girl," the detective said.

59
00:02:54.394 --> 00:02:57.556
"Being eaten by that plant was terrible!"

60
00:03:02.484 --> 00:03:04.405
Roxy placed a wiggling pod in front of him.

61
00:03:06.445 --> 00:03:08.646
"You can put this in a jail cell."

62
00:03:08.966 --> 00:03:09.426
She grinned.

63
00:03:10.226 --> 00:03:11.887
"Vic Nebula is inside!"

64
00:03:13.927 --> 00:03:15.468
Roxy returned to Jack's backyard.

65
00:03:15.488 --> 00:03:17.448
"Hey, guys!

66
00:03:17.948 --> 00:03:19.629
Can I see that strange plant now?"

67
00:03:20.609 --> 00:03:21.449
Jack shook his head.

68
00:03:21.469 --> 00:03:23.150
"The plant is dead.

69
00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:24.670
But you missed everything!

70
00:03:25.190 --> 00:03:26.531
The plant ate us!"

71
00:03:27.911 --> 00:03:29.211
Terrell nodded, smiling.

72
00:03:29.231 --> 00:03:31.692
"Then Rocket Girl saved us!"

73
00:03:33.192 --> 00:03:34.094
Roxy shook her head.

74
00:03:34.114 --> 00:03:36.818
"That's ridiculous, guys."

75
00:03:36.838 --> 00:03:38.941
"It's true!"

76
00:03:39.342 --> 00:03:39.983
Mara said.

77
00:03:40.844 --> 00:03:42.026
Roxy just laughed.
